      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "This sampler is highly complex.\n\nCFG scale and guidance do nothing.\n\nfolding is how slices are treated\nscheduling is the alpha scale behind folding\npadding is ignored currently and may be deprecated\npooling mode is critical be warned\n\n\ncos_similarity_gate is on no matter what you do here\n\n\npos_embdding not used currently\n\nanchor is ignored currently\n\ntop_k is the % of similarity you want to preserve\ntop_p is not used currently and may be deprecated\n\ntemperature is tied specifically to tau when active\n\nbeams aren't used yet\n\nmax_windows decides how many times you want to slice up your generation\n\ncontext_window_size decides how large you are willing to fan outward based on the topic into additional dimensions\n\nsliding_window_size is ignored if you make the max_windows high enough\nstride is ignored as well, but useful for lower windows\n\nforce projection if something complains, it'll go in the square hole, if not tell me\n\ncan manually force upscale here as well, which internally interpolates a projection\n\n\n-------\n\nuse_rose_similarity is the most critical part, recently discovered and will be codified as core."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
